'''Island of Ash''' (備長炭と謎の骨の島, ''Binchōtan Sumi to Nazo no Hone no Shima'', '''Island of Coal and Mysterious Bones''') is the [[Builder's Blitz Stages|Builder's Blitz]] stage that features [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] and [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] enemies. These stages have a chance to drop Beast Bones or Coal when cleared. This event was added in [[Version 6.3 Update|Version 6.3]].

